    },
    {
      "turn_index": 0,
      "phase": "opening",
      "speaker": "Moderator",
      "is_moderator": true,
      "text": "Today we are deciding: Which game to play later tonight",
      "selected_reason": "moderator",
      "tokens_in": 0,
      "tokens_out": 0
    },
    {
      "turn_index": 0,
      "phase": "opening",
      "speaker": "Moderator",
      "is_moderator": true,
      "text": "Here are the options on the table:",
      "selected_reason": "moderator",
      "tokens_in": 0,
      "tokens_out": 0
    },
    {
      "turn_index": 0,
      "phase": "opening",
      "speaker": "Moderator",
      "is_moderator": true,
      "text": "Option A - Minecraft: Engaging multiplayer experience; trade-off: Requires subscription and online connection; best for: Social gamers",
      "selected_reason": "moderator",
      "tokens_in": 0,
      "tokens_out": 0
    },
    {
      "turn_index": 0,
      "phase": "opening",
      "speaker": "Moderator",
      "is_moderator": true,
      "text": "Option B - Overcooked 2: Encourages teamwork and communication; trade-off: Can be chaotic and frustrating at times; best for: Players who enjoy cooperative challenges",
      "selected_reason": "moderator",
      "tokens_in": 0,
      "tokens_out": 0
    },
    {
      "turn_index": 0,
      "phase": "opening",
      "speaker": "Moderator",
      "is_moderator": true,
      "text": "Option C - Portal 2: Offers a humorous and intellectually stimulating single-player campaign; trade-off: Limited multiplayer options; best for: Fans of puzzle games and dark humor",
      "selected_reason": "moderator",
      "tokens_in": 0,
      "tokens_out": 0
    },
    {
      "turn_index": 0,
      "phase": "opening",
      "speaker": "Moderator",
      "is_moderator": true,
      "text": "Option D - Jackbox Party Pack: Provides a variety of easy-to-learn party games; trade-off: Some games may become repetitive; best for: Large groups and casual players",
      "selected_reason": "moderator",
      "tokens_in": 0,
      "tokens_out": 0
    },
    {
      "turn_index": 0,
      "phase": "opening",
      "speaker": "Moderator",
      "is_moderator": true,
      "text": "What's most important to you in a game for tonight: social interaction, intellectual challenge, or light-hearted fun?",
      "selected_reason": "moderator",
      "tokens_in": 0,
      "tokens_out": 0
    },
    {
      "turn_index": 1,
      "phase": "opening",
      "speaker": "Lena",
      "is_moderator": false,
      "text": "Hey, I'm hoping for something that keeps everyone engaged and having fun together.",
      "selected_reason": "weighted",
      "tokens_in": 1105,
      "tokens_out": 17
    },
    {
      "turn_index": 2,
      "phase": "opening",
      "speaker": "Julian",
      "is_moderator": false,
      "text": "Hey, I'm thinking we need something new to spice things up",
      "selected_reason": "weighted",
      "tokens_in": 1174,
      "tokens_out": 14
    },
    {
      "turn_index": 3,
      "phase": "opening",
      "speaker": "Aiden",
      "is_moderator": false,
      "text": "Hey, I'm thinking we need something with a bit of variety to keep things interesting.",
